@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF4FB
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #355777
skinparam ActorBorderColor #355777
skinparam ArrowColor #355777
hide footbox
autonumber
title Unauthenticated process liveness check

' Sources relative to repository root:
' backend/app/main.py
' backend/app/api/routes/health.py

actor "Monitor / deployment helper" as Monitor
participant "FastAPI / health route" as API
Monitor -> API : GET /health
API -> API : Return constant status
API --> Monitor : 200 {"status": "ok"}
note over API : No authentication, database query or provider call.\nSuccess confirms process availability; it does not confirm schema currency,\ndatabase connectivity or worker readiness.
@enduml
